 ing Exhibition Dates: September 17 - October 24\, 2026 Opening Reception: 
 Thursday\, September 17\, 5:30-7:30pm Presented in partnership with the Re
 use Alliance and Recology San Francisco and Sonoma Marin\, It’s Not Tras
 h: Reclaiming and Transforming honors artists who repurpose discarded mate
 rials to create work centered on sustainability\, storytelling\, and commu
 nity restoration. In collaboration with community participants\, Reuse All
 iance will be creating and exhibiting a textile-based art installation at 
 the upcoming exhibition at the Petaluma Arts Center. This summer\, the Reu
 se Alliance will be hosting a series of skill-based workshops centered aro
 und transforming and repurposing textile waste collected from clothing swa
